From eb6635bc4d8e7a02a97a4292a62c1e14e4d8f957 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Azra Bano <azrabano.work@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:26:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add sorted array level storage for L2 order books

- Store L2_MBP ladder levels in a contiguous array sorted worst-to-best
- Reuse emptied levels from a spare pool so steady-state deltas do not allocate
- Keep BTreeMap storage for L1_MBP and L3_MBO ladders
- Accept any best-first level iterator in the book analysis helpers
- Add a differential property test against the BTreeMap storage
- Add a zero-allocation test and an L2 delta stream bench

Resolves #4925
